<CENTER><div class="header"><B>Network Advertising Information</B></div></CENTER>
<br>
<div class="default" align=justify>
Unlike typical networks, AGN only allows the very best performing sites for a particular gaming environment to be affiliated. This is why the most popular sites on the internet for <strong>MMORPG's</strong>, <strong>TCG's</strong> and <strong>RTS</strong> can only be found within the Ascension Gaming Network.
<br><br>
AGN has a long history of providing advertising space for not only the very largest of internet corporations, but the smallest of local gaming stores as well. Whether you want to do run of network advertising in the millions of page views or target just one site for a few thousand page views, we have the resources to make things happen. Just a few of the past and recent advertisers include:
<br>
<ul>
<li>Electronic Arts</li>
<li>Hasbro</li>
<li>New Line Cinema</li>
<li>Sony Online</li>
<li>Mythic Entertainment</li>
<li>FunCom</li>
<li>Wizard's of the Coast</li>
<li>Google</li>
<li>And the list goes on and on...</li>
</ul>
<br>
Allowing only the most select of websites into the network has it's advantages. This creates a limited amount of crossover for unique visitors from site to site, as we only allow one gaming site per product. This is even more impressive when you consider our statistics:
<br><br>
